# vvaharness/backends/llm/models.py

The shared contract of the model routes (`cli`, `sdk`, `openai`, `deepagents`, `agent_sdk`). It holds the constants and helpers every route uses to decide whether to retry, how far to raise an output budget after a truncation, how to classify a refusal or a guardrail block, how to step a rejected reasoning-effort tier down, how per-request timeouts are clamped to a session clock, and which tools a detection stage may offer. It makes no model call itself.

Source: `vvaharness/backends/llm/models.py` (lines 1-1039)
